mmendations\": [\n    \"CRITICAL: Fix CORS - change allow_origins=['*'] to specific trusted domains. Remove allow_credentials=True or use specific origins only\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Implement authentication on all endpoints. Add JWT tokens or session-based auth before accessing /ws and /api/* routes\",\n    \"CRITICAL: Add rate limiting on /ws and API endpoints to prevent DoS and API bill shock from Gemini (max 3 concurrent WebSocket per IP, 100 req/min per IP)\",\n    \"HIGH: Sanitize user input before LLM injection - validate query_text (max 5000 chars), escape special characters, never concatenate directly into prompts\",\n    \"HIGH: Remove detailed error messages from HTTP responses - return generic 'Internal server error', log full exceptions server-side only\",\n    \"HIGH: Add HTTPS/TLS enforcement with SSL certificates and Strict-Transport-Security header\",\n    \"HIGH: Validate URLs in fetch engine - whitelist allowed domains (justice.gc.ca), block private IPs (127.0.0.1, 10.*, 172.16.*, 192.168.*)\",\n    \"MEDIUM: Set database file permissions to 0600 (owner read/write only) to prevent unauthorized access\",\n    \"MEDIUM: Add security headers (Content-Security-Policy, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection)\",\n    \"MEDIUM: Sanitize exception logging - avoid logging user-controlled data\",\n    \"LOW: Add Content-Security-Policy header for static assets to prevent XSS\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Key Findings Summary\n\n**Critical Issues (Fix Immediately):**\n1. **Broken CORS + No Auth** — System is completely open. Anyone can access HR policy data\n2. **Prompt Injection** — User queries flow directly into LLM prompts without sanitization\n3. **Unlimited Resource Consumption** — No rate limits on /ws or API endpoints\n\n**High Priority (Before Production):**\n- Replace `allow_origins=[\"*\"]` + `allow_credentials=True` with specific trusted domains\n- Implement JWT or session authentication\n- Add rate limiting middleware (FastAPI slowapi)\n-